      "created_at": "2013-11-06T07:29:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Kismet's Scattered Mind reads \"Whenever that hero deals damage, their player must discard 1 card\". Does \"whenever\" refer to one instance or something else? If Tempest is affected by Scattered Mind (has it in front of him) and plays Chain Lightning to deal damage to 3 targets, then does Tempest discard 3 cards?</p><p>Thanks.</p>",
